{
  "id": "1CH.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Damanyoojiga 11",
  "verseCount": 47,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi geembiit ghoah sugoocheanda Israeli ea Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gabassa geat buuneesean bea Israeli heeda Dawdi aba Hebroni, ak gwayeesha, “Ng'ula, aseasa geewooschi geakaagu ea foojeandaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghayi damanda waseewa Sawli sugoocheanda, guwoosi siida aruudu ak gweadu fuga Israeli; ak gwayeeshiineey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ‘Gayhuwa jeagiischoocheanda fugeasu was Israeli, ak gayhuuwa sugoocheanda fugeasu was Israeli’.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghapka gweargwa sean bea Israeli heeda sugoocheanda aba Hebroni; ak gwasin Dawdi neajeeda sea saawa aba Hebroni aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghoamwaar Dawdi ghoah sugoocheanda goombal Israeli, gawuurji gidanyaashta ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA ghayi rugu Samweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu gawa Dawdi nea goodeayi buuneesean bea Israeli ea ghwahita Yerusalemu, nea Yebusi gil, was heeda mida eemeeda Yebusi, was fuga bea ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda fuga Yebusi ak gwayeesha Dawdi, “Maynyuunyi jeedeaba mujiineani.” Amadu ghoang'waay Dawdi gheeda majeek bea Sayuni, nea mujiineeda Dawdihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Dawdi, “Siida wassean jea goosheeda ghabwar fuga Yebusi gayghoah siida haw nea ghoah shirikarajeanda haw.” Hean goosheeda Yoabu was orjeeda Seruya, ak geanung' ghoah siida haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goobiida Dawdi gheedida majeegiin; ak geeguura gheawungaaschi mujiineeda Dawdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwadeas mujiini meadajeega sean ghang'eada Milo ea gooneaweesa; ak ghwadeas Yoabu mujiini meatkweeda abit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwaheedu Dawdi muuchi, aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega gwandeayi sea niny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shirikareeda hees bea Dawdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga was shirikareeda hees meanyi bea Dawdihi, weat niny muuchi aba jeeda sugoocheanduumeadaanyi, sea Israeelessean, ak ghwanung' ghoah sugoocheanda, aba ginyaashta ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih mooneeda fuga meanyi bea Dawdihi: Yashobeyamu, bea eemeeda Hakmoni niny goombal fih samwagu niny gooyuuk ng'utaanyi aba bugusta fuga nyiit bughalaji samwagu ak ghabwar aba ng'eadagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba jeedeaba fugiga asamwagu mideawa uurjeenga mida murdeadaanyiin gwanda Eliyeseri was orjeeda Dodo, bea eemeeda Ahohi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwandeayi sea Dawdi aba Bas-damimu damanda bata geat fuga Filisti aba hoowa nea gagasa ng'ucheeda. Abeeda gwanda madamnyeanda nyiit ngaano, ak gamng'aw buuneeda aba madeeda fuga Filisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinaada aba bugusta madamnyeanda, ak gameaji, ak ghabwar fuga Filisti; ak gwalealu NG'UTAMIIDA aba uurda haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaweay fih samwagu hees was shirikara aba jeedeaba fugiga atiktam ea damanamughuushiin ak gwararang'eesa lagheaneeda ak gaweay heeda Dawdi aba gwaleeda Adulamu, was heeda wusa lugooda Filisti mida mooheeda Refaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damandida gwanda Dawdi ghoah; nea abeeda furiischoodiga Filisti gwanda Betlehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi Dawdi nea gagasa, “Uuw inyeeda gagoonan sih beega jea dali aba healadeeda Betlehemu mida ghuuta dooshta!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean ghabwasay fugiga assamwaguun museasooda Filisti, ak gwaramu beega aba healadeeda aba Betlehemu mida ghuuta dooshta, ak gweadu ak ghoadaw Dawdi. Ak ea mwali Dawdi; ak ghoahiida aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayi, “Gagasa gwasheagiidanean ASEETA ea measini ng'asheanji. Neada gaydali foojeandeaba fiisu? Aba gideaba gweadu nea ghwayiin eaweega nyaawa jeeda washta.” Hean ghaheawa ghwali. Ng'asheesu gwasin fuga asamwagu meanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Abishayi, was orjeeda geenyea Yoabu, ghoah siida ambal fih diktam ea damanamughuush. Ak gooyuuk ng'utaanyi ak gang'uchi fih bughalaji samwagu ak ghabwar, ak gwaheedu gheawungaaschi aba jeeda fuga assamwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoaw siida sisissa mureeda muuchi aba jeeda fuga hita diktam ea damanamughuush, ak ghoah shirikarajeanda nyaawa haw; ak ea mariiksiina fuga asamwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Benaya orjeeda Yehoyada siitaruusi bea Gabseli, ghayi sina ng'asheega heesi; niny ghabwar ng'anyeew iyeenya aba Moabu. Eara niny ghwararang'aada ak ghabwar ng'adiida aba jeeda shoomanda damanda abina gapkeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabwar siida Misri, was siida geaw muuchi, hita geawunda geatin muut. Abeeda siida Misri gwanda geatindaanyi ng'uta deena darearjeanda; iidu ghwararang'aada Benaya gawa headaanyi nea ghwaat gulupta, ak ghoasealda ng'uta ea geatinda siida Misri, ak ghabwara niny ng'utaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheesu gwasin Benaya was orjeeda Yehoyada, ak gwaheedu gheawungaaschi aba jeeda fuga asamwagu meanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geesissa mureeda aba jeeda fuga hita diktam ea damanamughuush, ak ea mariiksiina fuga asamwagu. Ak ghwayiin Dawdi niny goombal siidaanyi fur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga meanyi aba jeeda shirikara Asaheli gil orjeeda geenyea Yoabu, ea Elhanani orjeeda Dodo leabu Betlehemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Shamoti leabu Harodi, ea Helesi bea eemeeda Beloni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Ira orjeeda Ikeshi leabu Dekowa, ea Abieseri leabu Anatoti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Sibekayi bea eemeeda Hushati, ea Ilayi bea eemeeda Ahohi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Maharayi bea eemeeda Netofa, ea Heledi orjeeda Baana leabu Netofa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Itayi orjeeda Ribayi leabu Gibeya bea eemeeda Benjamini, ea Benaya leabu Biratoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
